  Object.assign(translations.zh, {"YOUR HIRING JOURNEY": "您的聘请流程", "A clearer path": "更清晰的流程，", "to the right helper.": "找到适合的家政帮手。", "Five simple steps to understand the process before making a decision.": "通过五个简单步骤，了解流程，安心作决定。", "Five-step hiring journey": "五步聘请流程", "Share your family priorities and the support you are looking for.": "告诉我们家庭最重视的需求与期望获得的协助。", "Review suitable helpers": "了解合适的家政帮手", "Discuss available profiles and what suits your household.": "讨论现有候选人资料，了解与您家庭的适合程度。", "Discuss & interview": "沟通与面试", "Ask questions and understand the selection arrangements.": "提出问题，了解甄选及面试安排。", "Documents & preparation": "文件与准备", "Review the required paperwork and the next steps for your case.": "了解本次申请需要的文件与后续步骤。", "Arrival & support": "抵达与后续支持", "Confirm arrival arrangements and how to contact our team.": "确认抵达安排，以及如何联络我们的团队。", "Photos are genuine Readymaid team, training and arrival moments.": "照片均取自真实 Readymaid 团队、培训及抵达现场。", "REAL READYMAID MOMENTS": "READYMAID 真实记录", "Real activities. Real preparation.": "真实活动，真实准备。", "See our original training and arrival photography.": "浏览我们的原始培训及抵达照片。", "QUESTIONS BEFORE YOU HIRE": "聘请前常见问题", "Frequently asked": "常见", "questions.": "问题解答。", "Clear answers to help your family decide with confidence.": "简单清晰的答案，帮助家庭安心作出决定。", "Hiring frequently asked questions": "聘请常见问题", "What is the current hiring package price?": "目前的聘请配套多少钱？", "Our advertised standard package is RM15,500. Please review the latest written quotation for inclusions, payment stages and applicable terms before proceeding.": "目前公布的标准配套为 RM15,500。请在决定前查阅最新书面报价，确认所含服务、付款阶段与适用条款。", "Can I review profiles and interview helpers?": "可以查看候选人资料和安排面试吗？", "Tell us your household needs. Our team can explain available helper profiles and the interview arrangements for your case.": "告诉我们家庭需求。团队会说明现有家政帮手资料及适用于您个案的面试安排。", "How long does the hiring process take?": "整个聘请流程需要多久？", "Timing depends on availability, documents, approvals and travel. Ask our team for a current estimate based on your circumstances.": "时间视人选、文件、审批及行程而定。请向团队了解适用于您个案的最新预计时间。", "What does the 2-year warranty cover?": "两年保障包括哪些内容？", "Maid runaway only.": "仅限女佣逃跑的情况。", "Which documents do I need?": "需要准备哪些文件？", "Required documents depend on the employer, worker and current official requirements. We will explain the list relevant to your case.": "所需文件视雇主、家政帮手及现行官方要求而定。我们会说明适用于您个案的清单。", "What support is available after arrival?": "抵达后提供哪些支持？", "Our team can provide follow-up guidance. Specific service and warranty entitlements follow your signed written terms.": "我们的团队可提供后续指导。具体服务及保障权益以双方签署的书面条款为准。", "Still have questions? Chat with Readymaid": "还有疑问？WhatsApp 联系 Readymaid", "Ask Readymaid a hiring question on WhatsApp": "通过 WhatsApp 咨询 Readymaid 聘请事宜", "Final package and warranty coverage follow the written agreement.": "最终配套及保障范围以书面协议为准。", "Readymaid team photographed together at the airport": "Readymaid 团队在机场的真实合照", "Original Readymaid office orientation session": "Readymaid 办公室的真实培训及指导现场", "Readymaid helpers participating in real practical training": "Readymaid 家政帮手进行真实实务培训", "Frame from an original Readymaid orientation video": "Readymaid 原始培训视频画面", "Real Readymaid team arrival at the airport with luggage": "Readymaid 团队携行李抵达机场的真实照片", "Actual orientation session at Readymaid office": "Readymaid 办公室的真实指导及培训现场", "Actual hands-on practical training by Readymaid helpers": "Readymaid 家政帮手的真实实务培训", "Readymaid team and helpers photographed at an airport": "Readymaid 团队与家政帮手在机场的真实合照"});
